    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hack, slash, block and burn your way though a huge, procedurally-generated, dungeon roguelike.<br></li><li>Unleash death on your enemies with bows and magic.<br></li><li>Unearth ancient secrets, treasures and mysteries... and shatter them to pieces.<br></li><li>Lose yourself in the flow of exploration, mystery, and blood-soaked combat.<br></li><li>Xbox controller and mouse/keyboard input options.<br></li><li>Adjustable performance and resolution settings with wide-screen monitor support.<br></li><li>Runs great on Steamdeck.<br></li><li>Marvel and despair knowing this game was made by a single indie developer.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hack, slash, block and burn your way though a huge, procedurally-generated, dungeon roguelike.<br></li><li>Unleash death on your enemies with bows and magic.<br></li><li>Unearth ancient secrets, treasures and mysteries... and shatter them to pieces.<br></li><li>Lose yourself in the flow of exploration, mystery, and blood-soaked combat.<br></li><li>Xbox controller and mouse/keyboard input options.<br></li><li>Adjustable performance and resolution settings with wide-screen monitor support.<br></li><li>Runs great on Steamdeck.<br></li><li>Marvel and despair knowing this game was made by a single indie developer.</li></ul>",
